      <sect2 role="installation">
        <title>Installation of Cosmic-comp</title>

    <para>Prepare Cosmic-comp for compilation:</para>

      <para>To Build the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="make">cargo build --release</userinput></screen>

      <para>Now Install the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="install">install -vDm755 target/release/cosmic-comp /usr/bin/cosmic-comp &amp;&amp;

install -vDm644 data/keybindings.ron \
  /usr/share/cosmic/com.system76.CosmicSettings.Shortcuts/v1/defaults &amp;&amp;

install -vDm644 data/tiling-exceptions.ron \
  /usr/share/cosmic/com.system76.CosmicSettings.WindowRules/v1/tiling_exception_defaults </userinput></screen>

      </sect2>

